{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-74983" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Given that  $\\text{Null}(A)={[\\begin{aligned}-5{x}_{3} \\\\ 0 \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]\\,:\\,{x}_{3}\\in R}$, find a basis for $\\text{Null}(A).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064941/state.json" "file_sha256" "8fd059646fee128a0be8d4870e075778d91b477e7aaf1cde6772706b029726e6"} {"question" "q-74983" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Any vector in $\\text{Null}(A)$ has the form\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-5{x}_{3} \\\\ 0 \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{3}\\in R.\n$$\n\nExpanding, we get\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-5{x}_{3} \\\\ 0 \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]={x}_{3}[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, a basis for $\\text{Null}(A)$ is\n\n$$\nB={[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}\n$$\n\nsince it is a linearly independent set and its vectors generate $\\text{Null}(A).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064941/state.json" "file_sha256" "8fd059646fee128a0be8d4870e075778d91b477e7aaf1cde6772706b029726e6"} {"question" "q-74983" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064941/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bc264429e4f25b6e170cfaf2a0df06ead3b3411fb1957d5ecd420df18f600a71"} {"question" "q-74983" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064941/state.json" "file_sha256" "8fd059646fee128a0be8d4870e075778d91b477e7aaf1cde6772706b029726e6"} {"question" "q-74983" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "B={[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}"] ["math" "B={[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}"] ["math" "B={[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}"] ["math" "B={[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}"] ["math" "B={[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064941/state.json" "file_sha256" "8fd059646fee128a0be8d4870e075778d91b477e7aaf1cde6772706b029726e6"} {"question" "q-74983" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "B={[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064941/state.json" "file_sha256" "8fd059646fee128a0be8d4870e075778d91b477e7aaf1cde6772706b029726e6"} {"question" "q-35529" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Given that  $\\text{Null}(A)={[\\begin{aligned}-3{x}_{3}+2{x}_{4} \\\\ 2{x}_{3}-5{x}_{4} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{4}\\end{aligned}]\\,:\\,{x}_{3},{x}_{4}\\in R}$, find a basis for $\\text{Null}(A).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064941/state.json" "file_sha256" "8fd059646fee128a0be8d4870e075778d91b477e7aaf1cde6772706b029726e6"} {"question" "q-35529" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Any vector in $\\text{Null}(A)$ has the form\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-3{x}_{3}+2{x}_{4} \\\\ 2{x}_{3}-5{x}_{4} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{4}\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{3},{x}_{4}\\in R.\n$$\n\nExpanding, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}-3{x}_{3}+2{x}_{4} \\\\ 2{x}_{3}-5{x}_{4} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{4}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-3{x}_{3} \\\\ 2{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{4} \\\\ -5{x}_{4} \\\\ 0 \\\\ {x}_{4}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={x}_{3}[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{4}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore a basis for $\\text{Null}(A)$ is\n\n$$\nB={[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}\n$$\n\nsince it is a linearly independent set and its vectors generate $\\text{Null}(A).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064941/state.json" "file_sha256" "8fd059646fee128a0be8d4870e075778d91b477e7aaf1cde6772706b029726e6"} {"question" "q-35529" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064941/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bc264429e4f25b6e170cfaf2a0df06ead3b3411fb1957d5ecd420df18f600a71"} {"question" "q-35529" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064941/state.json" "file_sha256" "8fd059646fee128a0be8d4870e075778d91b477e7aaf1cde6772706b029726e6"} {"question" "q-35529" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "B={[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}"] ["math" "B={[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}"] ["math" "B={[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}"] ["math" "B={[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}"] ["math" "B={[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064941/state.json" "file_sha256" "8fd059646fee128a0be8d4870e075778d91b477e7aaf1cde6772706b029726e6"} {"question" "q-35529" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "B={[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064941/state.json" "file_sha256" "8fd059646fee128a0be8d4870e075778d91b477e7aaf1cde6772706b029726e6"} {"question" "q-111349" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Given that  $\\text{Null}(A)={[\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ -3{x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]\\,:\\,{x}_{2}\\in R}$, find a basis for $\\text{Null}(A).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064941/state.json" "file_sha256" "8fd059646fee128a0be8d4870e075778d91b477e7aaf1cde6772706b029726e6"} {"question" "q-111349" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Any vector in $\\text{Null}(A)$ has the form\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ -3{x}_{2}\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{2}\\in R.\n$$\n\nExpanding, we get \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ -3{x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]={x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ \\,\\,1 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, a basis for $\\text{Null}(A)$ is\n\n$$\nB={[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ \\,\\,1 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]}\n$$\n\nsince it is a linearly independent set that generates $\\text{Null}(A).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064941/state.json" "file_sha256" "8fd059646fee128a0be8d4870e075778d91b477e7aaf1cde6772706b