).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064941/state.json" "file_sha256" "8fd059646fee128a0be8d4870e075778d91b477e7aaf1cde6772706b029726e6"} {"question" "q-74984" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Any vector in $\\text{Null}(A)$ has the form\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{4}-2{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3}+2{x}_{4} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{4}\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{3},{x}_{4}\\in R.\n$$\n\nExpanding, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{4}-2{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3}+2{x}_{4} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{4}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{4} \\\\ 2{x}_{4} \\\\ 0 \\\\ {x}_{4}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={x}_{3}[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{4}[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore a basis for $\\text{Null}(A)$ is\n\n$$\nB={[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}\n$$\n\nsince it is a linearly independent set and its vectors generate $\\text{Null}(A).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064941/state.json" "file_sha256" "8fd059646fee128a0be8d4870e075778d91b477e7aaf1cde6772706b029726e6"} {"question" "q-74984" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064941/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bc264429e4f25b6e170cfaf2a0df06ead3b3411fb1957d5ecd420df18f600a71"} {"question" "q-74984" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064941/